<title>USA: Revlon names president of international unit.</title>
<headline>Revlon names president of international unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revlon Inc said on Thursday it named Alex Kumar president of the international division of its consumer products subsidiary.</p>
<p>The company said Kumar would report to George Fellows, the president and chief operating officer of Revlon.</p>
<p>Most recently, Kumar was senior vice president of international operations at Bausch &amp; Lomb Inc.</p>
</text>
